# Opposition Agent: Event$ Moved | ValidCard$ Card.OppOwn |
# FoundSearchingLibrary$ True | Origin$ Library | ReplaceWith$ RepExile.
# Rampant Growth's search really searched the library, so the Island it finds
# carries FoundSearchingLibrary (ChangeZoneEffect.java:1308) and the Agent's
# line replaces its move to the battlefield (ReplaceMoved.java:92-98): it is
# exiled instead, and the Agent's controller gets an Effect letting them play
# it. The search itself is made under the Agent controller's control
# (ADR-0040); the one scripted controller answers the pick either way.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 1 G
tapformana human 2 G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 3
queue cardchoice 5
resolvestack
# On the Agent controller's turn the exiled Island is a land they may play
# (MayPlay$ on Card.IsRemembered, AffectedZone$ Exile). Once it leaves exile
# the Effect forgets it and exiles itself (ForgetOnMoved$ Exile).
advance 13
playland ai 5
